| resource | retained amount | rejected limit | rejected |
| --- | ---: | ---: | --- |
| Four-sample complete history | 6 | 5 | true |
| Empty initial and stop metadata | 2 | 1 | true |
| Whole generated signal | 4 | 3 | true |

Zero optional history quota retains 6 records; zero optional signal quota generates 4 samples. Independent owned copy true; invalid last sample before quota true; unsafe bin conversion rejected true; nonfinite state rejected true; caller input unchanged true.
